    "text": "The allotment of land specified in the Order No. 308 of 1985 madeunder the Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act(Chapter 460) and published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 371/12 dated 15.10.1985 is vested absolutely in the State and thepossession of which has been taken for or on behalf of the Stateunder Para (a) of Section 40 of the aforesaid Act. But by the virtue ofpowers vested in me by Sub section (1) of Section 39 (a) (inserted byAct, No. 8 of 1979) of the Land Acquisition Act. I, GayanthaKarunatilleke, Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms dohereby divest only the allotment described in the Schedule I below.",
